## RoundEndSystem

round-end-system-shuttle-called-announcement = 已派遣一架緊急穿梭機。預計抵達時間：{ $time } { $units }。
round-end-system-shuttle-already-called-announcement = 緊急穿梭機已經派出。
round-end-system-shuttle-auto-called-announcement = 已派遣一架自動船員輪班穿梭機。預計抵達時間：{ $time } { $units }。若需延長輪班時間，請召回該穿梭機。
round-end-system-shuttle-recalled-announcement = 緊急穿梭機已召回。
round-end-system-shuttle-sender-announcement = 太空站
round-end-system-round-restart-eta-announcement = 正在 { $time } { $units } 重新開始本輪...
eta-units-minutes =
    { $amount ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }
eta-units-seconds =
    { $amount ->
        [one] second
       *[other] seconds
    }
